0 // Source: all thirteen instruction pages reviewed 2026-10-13; page13 is final view, twelve construction steps.
0 // Toolo geometry remains approximate; hinge retention, physical fit and rotating clearance are not verified.
0 // Page12: two sideways window assemblies per gondola, windows facing opposite X sides, blue plate over their joined stud faces.
0 // Pedestal steps run along X, perpendicular to the long face of the tower; top landing 320x240 supports the 240x160 tower with a one-stud ledge.
